SUMMARY:Bob James
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - JPMorganChase Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. Pianist and composer Bob James is a foundational figure in smooth jazz\, famous for his instrumental "Angela" (the theme from TV's Taxi) and decades of work as a bandleader\, arranger\, and member of the group Fourplay.
